5\"><div class=\"api_method_header px-3\"><div class=\"api_method_header_left d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center justify-content-sm-between align-items-center\"><div><i class=\"icon-code\"></i> \n            <strong>Struktura żądania</strong></div></div></div><div id=\"api_method_request_content\" class=\"api_details visible\">\n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"authenticate\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">authenticate <span>(authenticateType)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Element służy do uwierzytelniania konta w celu wywołania metody</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"systemKey\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level1\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">systemKey <span>(string)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Klucz wykorzystywany podczas uwierzytelniania. Zapoznaj się z <a href=\"https://pomoc.idobooking.com/dodatkowe-moduly/api\">instrukcją generowania klucza</a></p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"systemLogin\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level1\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">systemLogin <span>(string)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Login użytkownika panelu IdoSell Booking</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"lang\">\n                    <div class=\"api